{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03279","headline":"春日宴宋主簿山亭得寒字 · 宋之问","name":"春日宴宋主簿山亭得寒字","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"公子正邀欢，林亭春未兰。\n攀岩践苔易，迷路出花难。\n窗覆垂杨煖，阶侵瀑水寒。\n帝城归路直，留兴接鵷鸾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03279.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03279","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}